*   **The Overvoltage Trap:** In aqueous $NaCl$, the SOP of $H_2O$ is higher than $Cl^-$, yet $Cl_2$ is evolved. This is because the oxidation of water to $O_2$ is kinetically slow and requires an additional "overvoltage".
